+ * The layouts beyond the nine study ones (bottom rings, +-25 screen
+ * speakers, U+180 heights, zenith exclusion) have no panlab ground truth
+ * yet; pin the ring sizes so the clustering/completion rules cannot
+ * silently change. 10.2.9.3's bottom ring {B000, B+-045} lacks rears and
+ * completes with +-135 (its front pair sits at 45); sound system E's
+ * lone B000 completes with the standard +-110. */
+
+static const struct {
